<!-- The Chupathingy menus' DELTA PROFILE (Profiles' DELTA PROFILE row, and
Online Games' Start): the player's own Delta profile (CLAN's emblem drawn
over the panel by profile_screen.c), laid out as Profiles
is: its sections on the left, the section in the Xbox's panel on the right,
and its prompts (Y asks the site again, B goes back, A chooses). What each
section says is port/linux/game/profile_screen.c's, put in these widgets by
menu_functions.c ("port delta profile update"); its dialogs (Link Profile,
Open on the Web, unlinking) are Online Games'. Privacy is a settings page
(tools/port_settings.py). -->
